    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Among the Stars</i> is a <strong>competitive 2D rhythm game</strong> featuring a minimalist and modern design, along with an electronic soundtrack. Immerse yourself in a space-themed universe where each note challenges your reflexes and skill. With <strong>regular esports competitions</strong> and a <strong>built-in level editor</strong>, <i>Among the Stars</i> lets you not only play but create and share your own unique levels. Perfect for rhythm game enthusiasts looking for both solo and competitive play!</p>",
